  "description": "Pure Scene adapter and input policy for FS.GG.Game — projects FS.GG.Game.Core simulation primitives (Point/Rect/Cell and pathfinding routes) onto FS.GG.UI.Scene drawables at the render edge, and ships the default command→key keymap binding the Game.Core command vocabulary onto FS.GG.UI.KeyboardInput's keymap mechanism. Also provides Elmish-shaped renderer backend selection (SVG default; Pixi/Babylon declared) over an adapter registry keyed by game-state type. Reaches UP to FS.GG.UI.*; no Skia, deterministic. Per ADR-0022 §2.",
  "id": "FS.GG.Game.Render",
  "isPrerelease": false,
